<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103467" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρά̄-ορος</span></b> , 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέτρωρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀείρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>yoked four together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ἄρσενες ἵπποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					13.81
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				723
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Tim.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				204
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ἅρμα</span> a
			<i>four-horsed</i> chariot, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				10.65
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίφρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					958
				</span></i>
			 (cj.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					675
				</span></i>
			; also 
				contr.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέτρωρος ὄχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					1229
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέτρωρον ἅρμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					483
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				860
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέτρωρον</span>
			<i>a team of four</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				1.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Im.</u>
				2.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>four-legged</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετραόρου φάσμα ταύρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					508
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέτρωρον, τό</span>, <i>upper surface of astragalus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Oss.</u>
				38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.775
			</span></i>.</div>
